Dexterous Hand Paper Digest

This standalone project was prepared from suyoutzy/robotics_paper_daily,
which is a fork of cold-young/robotics_paper_daily:
https://github.com/cold-young/robotics_paper_daily

The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.
The standalone daily_digest implementation, Feishu delivery workflow,
metadata-only journal collection, and migration changes were added for
this project's dexterous end-effector research digest.

The migration preserves the user's confirmed digest and deduplication
metadata. It excludes the upstream's legacy scripts and historical
paper-index website. The upstream's subsequent daily results are not
synchronized or consumed by this workflow.
